# Inventory & inspection checklist

Complete on arrival, before assembly. Photograph each item as received — it matters for warranty
and RMA disputes. Cross-reference [`../bill-of-materials.md`](../bill-of-materials.md) and
[`../accessories.md`](../accessories.md).

## Received items

| Item | Ordered | Received | Undamaged | Photo | Serial / marking | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| | | | | | | |

## Counts and fit checks

- [ ] Every quantity matches the order line item
- [ ] Variant matches what was intended (read the invoice string, not the product name)
- [ ] Fasteners, cables, and adapters accounted for
- [ ] Anything that must physically fit has been measured, not assumed

## Inspection points

- [ ] Connectors intact, no bent pins, no creased ribbon cables
- [ ] No shipping damage to boards or enclosures
- [ ] Serial numbers recorded in [`../records/order-and-warranty.md`](../records/order-and-warranty.md)

